<section id="S2" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">2 </span><span id="S2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_slanted">SimpleQA Verified</span></h2>

<div id="S2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="S2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_slanted">SimpleQA Verified</span> benchmark dataset was carefully curated to correct a range of issues present in the original SimpleQA benchmark <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wei et al., 2024a</a>)</cite>, likely caused by misaligned incentives of human raters who created the original benchmark prompts and and missing subsequent filtering and validation stages. The complete methodology how <span id="S2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_slanted">SimpleQA Verified</span> was created is outlined in the following subsections in the order they were performed. The authors carried out these tasks themselves. Table <a href="#S2.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 2 SimpleQA Verified ‣ SimpleQA Verified: A Reliable Factuality Benchmark to Measure Parametric Knowledge" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> illustrates our methodology and shows how many questions remain after each processing step.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S2.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S2.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S2.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Processing steps to create <span id="S2.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_slanted">SimpleQA Verified</span>.</span></figcaption>
<div id="S2.T2.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:341.6pt;height:103.3pt;vertical-align:-50.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-84.4pt,25.5pt) scale(0.669230231760703,0.669230231760703) ;">
