<span id="S3.T5.5.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">In 2019, a total of 8,333 UN Volunteers served in 54 United Nations missions, agencies, funds, and programs across the globe.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">INCORRECT</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">CORRECT</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T5.5.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.3.4" class="ltx_td" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.3.5" class="ltx_td" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T5.5.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">What is the exact number of visitors who visited Edinburgh Castle in 2018?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">2,111,578 (acceptable range: anything between 2,006,000 and 2,217,157)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">According to the official figures released by the Association of Leading Visitor Attractions (ALVA), the exact number of visitors to Edinburgh Castle in 2018 was 2,111,532.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">INCORRECT</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"><span id="S3.T5.5.1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">CORRECT</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T5.5.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.T5.5.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
